  "faq": [
    {
      "a": "BC's small-scale multi-unit housing rules allow more homes on many urban lots, but each municipality sets the details and many lots are excluded. Check the lot's zoning with the municipality before you plan a suite or coach house.",
      "gen": "bank-faq",
      "q": "Can I add a suite or coach house to a house in Ladner?"
    },
    {
      "a": "It is strongly recommended. Make the offer subject to an inspection so a qualified inspector can look at the roof, structure, drainage, electrical and heating before you remove conditions.",
      "gen": "bank-faq",
      "q": "Do I need a home inspection when buying in Ladner?"
    },
    {
      "a": "School catchments are set by address, so use the school district's catchment locator with the exact address. Catchment lines change, so check before you write an offer.",
      "gen": "bank-faq",
      "q": "How do I find out which school serves an address in Ladner?"
    },
    {
      "a": "Yes. Jared Gibbons, REALTOR® with Royal LePage Little Oak Realty, books private showings across the Fraser Valley and Metro Vancouver. Call or text 604-928-1361, or use the contact form on this site.",
      "gen": "muse-generic",
      "q": "Can I book a private showing with Jared?"
    }
  ],
